{"color":"amber","height":180,"id":"n_files","kind":"node","parent":"n_about","text":"## Where an edit goes\n\nAn edit of a model is written into that model's own file under `models/`. The board file stores where a file sits, never what is in it.\n\nThis browser keeps the board and the changed files. **Reset the example** at the bottom of the page brings the first state back.","type":"text","width":680,"x":960,"y":80,"z":"d"}
