{"height":180,"id":"n_welcome","kind":"node","parent":"n_about","text":"## A board of a repository's own files\n\nEvery model here is a file of the example repository, drawn by its own modeler.\n\n- **Double-click** a model to edit it in place.\n- **Done**, or a zoom of the board, ends the editing.\n- Text, Image, Group and Model in the toolbar add to the board.","type":"text","width":660,"x":260,"y":80,"z":"c"}
